{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"選委會選舉投票結束　票站關門現場\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/1759-LIVE-ELEX-261122.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】選委會選舉投票晚上6時結束，現場是位於港灣道體育館的票站，票站門口有工作人員正式關門，不再讓選民入去投票。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:43:44.621257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":61,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:11:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T17:17:41.925754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:24.289182+00:00","content_hash":"ab102bccbe5979efae328519139af2e4456332b14030209e6879f1c327caff2c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}